  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_TIEFLING_DARKVISION",
   "name": "Darkvision",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "grant",
     "id": "ID_VISION_DARKVISION",
     "type": "Vision"
    },
    {
     "kind": "stat",
     "name": "darkvision:range",
     "value": "60",
     "bonus": "base"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_TIEFLING_FIENDISH_LEGACY",
   "name": "Fiendish Legacy",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You are the recipient of a legacy that grants you supernatural abilities. Choose a legacy from the Fiendish Legacies table. You gain the level 1 benefit of the chosen legacy.</p>\n<p>When you reach character levels 3 and 5, you learn a higher-level spell, as shown on the table.</p>\n<p>You always have that spell prepared. You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain the ability to cast it in that way when you finish a Long Rest. You can also cast the spell using any spell slots you have of the appropriate level.</p>\n<p>Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for the spells you cast with this trait (choose the ability when you select the legacy).</p><table><tr><th>Legacy</th><th>Level 1</th><th>Level 3</th><th>Level 5</th></tr><tr><td>Abyssal</td><td>Resistance to Poison damage; Poison Spray cantrip</td><td>Ray of Sickness</td><td>Hold Person</td></tr><tr><td>Chthonic</td><td>Resistance to Necrotic damage; Chill Touch cantrip</td><td>False Life</td><td>Ray of Enfeeblement</td></tr><tr><td>Infernal</td><td>Resistance to Fire damage; Fire Bolt cantrip</td><td>Hellish Rebuke</td><td>Darkness</td></tr></table>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "select",
     "type": "Species Trait Option",
     "name": "Fiendish Legacy",
     "supports": "Fiendish Legacy"
    },
    {
     "kind": "select_param",
     "name": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability",
     "options": [
      "Intelligence",
      "Wisdom",
      "Charisma"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_TIEFLING_OTHERWORLDLY_PRESENCE",
   "name": "Otherworldly Presence",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You know the Thaumaturgy cantrip. When you cast it with this trait, the spell uses the same spellcasting ability you use for your Fiendish Legacy trait.</p>\n<pre>   Level 3                    Level 5\n   Ray of Sickness            Hold Person</pre>\n<pre>   False Life                 Ray of Enfeeblement</pre>\n<pre>   Hellish Rebuke             Darkness</pre>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_THAUMATURGY",
     "mode": "known_cantrip",
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_OPTION_FIENDISH_LEGACY_ABYSSAL",
   "name": "Abyssal",
   "type": "Species Trait Option",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "supports": [
    "Fiendish Legacy"
   ],
   "description": "<p>You have Resistance to Poison damage. You also know the Poison Spray cantrip. Level 3 spell: Ray of Sickness. Level 5 spell: Hold Person.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "grant",
     "id": "ID_INTERNAL_CONDITION_DAMAGE_RESISTANCE_POISON",
     "type": "Condition"
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_POISON_SPRAY",
     "mode": "known_cantrip",
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "level": 3,
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_RAY_OF_SICKNESS",
     "mode": "always_prepared",
     "free_cast": {
      "uses": 1,
      "recharge": "long_rest"
     },
     "also_with_slots": true,
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "level": 5,
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_HOLD_PERSON",
     "mode": "always_prepared",
     "free_cast": {
      "uses": 1,
      "recharge": "long_rest"
     },
     "also_with_slots": true,
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "legacy": "Abyssal",
    "resistance": "poison",
    "cantrip": "Poison Spray",
    "level_3_spell": "Ray of Sickness",
    "level_5_spell": "Hold Person"
   }
  },
